#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added access to speeds 9 and 10 using the `9` and `0` keys.  Unlimited speed "
"has been moved to `\\`, and pause toggle is already done with Space.  These "
"can be rebound using the `KEYEVENT_ _SPEED_ _SET_ _TO_ _UNLIMITED` and "
"`KEYEVENT_ _SPEED_ _TOGGLE_ _PAUSE` bindings in the config.txt file."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added access to cycling through all speeds 1–10,922.3* using the `-` and `=` "
"keys.  These can be rebound using the `KEYEVENT_ _SPEED_ _DECREASE_ "
"_STANDARD` and `KEYEVENT_ _SPEED_ _INCREASE_ _STANDARD` bindings in the "
"config.txt file."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"* With the exception of speed 33, which is used internally to represent "
"unlimited speed, and will be skipped over."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added access to cycling through all the intermediate speeds (there are three "
"steps from each standard speed level to the next; and the two intermediate "
"speeds are shown as .3 and .7).  These can be accessed using the `shift+-` "
"and `shift+=` keys and can be rebound using the `KEYEVENT_ _SPEED_ "
"_DECREASE_ _SMALL` and `KEYEVENT_ _SPEED_ _INCREASE_ _SMALL` bindings in the "
"config.txt file."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added scrolling with the pg up/pg down keys to the Inn guest list and the "
"Harbour ship list."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a \"too close\" message to Inns when they're too close to other Inns "
"and so will have fewer guests."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the number of units a leader is leading in the leadership status on the "
"info pane."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added clicking on the leadership status on the info pane to go to the "
"location of the leader of the current unit."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash that happens when selecting certain Mayan towns and Norman and "
"Greek units."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Inn guest selection sometimes changing when a guest leaves, "
"resulting in sometimes hiring the wrong unit."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Inn hire button not getting disabled properly when a guest leaves, "
"resulting in sometimes hiring the wrong unit."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Inn hire button getting randomly re-enabled after disabling but "
"without a selection change."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Draw the building information (builder icon, hit points bar, progress bar, "
"and information panel) above the link lines and buttons."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed Phoenix not revealing the leadership status (icon and info pane field) "
"of units."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the corrupted display of a Mayan Town name, a Norman unit name, and a "
"Greek unit name in the Esperanto, Polish, and Russian translations."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed the mouse cursor appearing under instead of over some text."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the alignment of the town migration button (pink cross with arrows in "
"a box) not being in the centre."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the calculation of the nearest Market, which sometimes resulted in "
"hiring a Caravan from a slightly further away Market."
