"is present and the spy button is showing."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.2 -- 2025-03-04"
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show town goods demand satisfaction (quality of life) to know how much goods "
"are demanded and how much are being supplied--and thus the level of the "
"bonus."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show a progress bar for Towers of Science and War Factories."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the unit path line (and building connection lines) animation speed "
"breaking on game speed unlimited (9).  This should also fix the issue some "
"users were having where moving the mouse would speed up the line animation."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed the building hitbars looking kind of off and tilted."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fix high CPU usage on showing help on hover."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Scale unit hitbar widths with the (square root of) their maximum hitpoints, "
"to give a better idea of units' toughness at a glance."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Add more hitbar colours (dark green, orange, red) to make judging unit "
"tougness easier."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Draw town/building link lines consistently in the same direction, regardless "
"of which side is selected.  Since some links make sense only as bi-"
"directional flow, these links are drawn alternating in both direction."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Darkened the bottom-left pixel of the hitbar outline to make it look more in "
"place."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.1 -- 2025-02-25"
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added game speed display to top-right of the map and \"PAUSED\" in the "
"middle."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the guest count in an inn, to make it easy to know whether scrolling is "
"even required."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the amount that non-spy units have been rewarded, so that it's easier "
"to tell the effects of the contribution on loyalty."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed high CPU usage when moving the mouse cursor in-game.  This should also "
"fix the unit path line looking like it's moving when the mouse cursor is "
"moved."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed minimap bounding box colours."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Display inn guest list from newest at the top to oldest at the bottom, so "
"that it's quicker to check inns for new mercenaries."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Preferentially use builders from undamaged buildings further away instead of "
"from closer buildings that are still not fully repaired."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use all of the available space in the building info pane to show wider unit "
"hitbars, so that they're easier to comprehend."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the missing portion of unit hitbars in the building info pane, so that "
"it's easier to tell when a unit is missing hitpoints."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Draw a hitbar for the general/king in a camp, so that you can see his health."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Properly centre units in the building info pane, so that the hitbars are "
"clearly discernible."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use a four-slot screen for the mode selection.  This gives more space to "
"expand the description text."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use roman numerals for numbering modes on the mode selection screen.  This "
"aesthetic is more appropriate."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Make mode selection screen translatable.  No translations have been "
"completed yet, though."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.0 -- 2025-02-21"
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Display the current running mode in top-right of the main menu."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a rudimentary running mode switcher accessible from a button at the "
"top-right of the main menu."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Made the game look smoother by running at at a graphical 60 FPS."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added cyan highlight to selected units, making for easier identification."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added coloured outline to hit bars, making it easier to distinguish friendly "
"units' hit bars from enemies'."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show a hitbar for firms when they are at less than 100% HP."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added builder icon to buildings with builders in them, allowing easy at-a-"
"glance identification of them."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by constantly animating buildings at a fixed "
"rate."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by constantly animating water and other terrain "
"at a fixed rate."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by having the water be more sloshy and run "
"approximately into the south-western direction as the waves imply."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by continuing rain and snow while game is paused."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Display more details when a multiplayer sync error occurs to help hunt down "
"and fix the cause."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fixed the 100% CPU usage all the time problem."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed scrolling to the right and down not working properly."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the unit path line flow direction to go from the unit to its "
"destination instead of backwards."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Centred the info pane (the one below the minimap) so that it's no longer off-"
"centre."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed a memory leak when loading a saved game."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed a memory leak with unit waypoints."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Use yellow colour for highlighting units on hover instead of cyan."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made it easier to see when units are low on hitpoints by making the unit "
"hitbars wider."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Change right and bottom cursor boundaries to allow the cursor to go further."
msgstr ""

